  "description": "<style>\n:root { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222; line-height: 1.5 }\nh1 { font-size: 1.6em }\nh2 { font-size: 1.3em; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 0.2em }\nimg { height: auto }\nli { margin-bottom: 0.4em }\ntable { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100% }\nth, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top }\nth { background-color: #f5f5f5 }\n.hero { margin-bottom: 1em }\n</style>\n<h1>Non-slip Wear-resistant Mouse Pad, Universal for Office &amp; Gaming, Precision Pad</h1><div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"https://test.ebuyl.com/api/v1/files/products/2026/08/14/3bdc9af97f3e8c4a3e6435b8edc75517.jpg\" alt=\"TIGERWINGS non-slip mouse pad on desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"></div><h2>Core Selling Points</h2><p>This TIGERWINGS mouse pad combines a durable, wear-resistant surface with a non-slip rubber base, providing reliable tracking and stability for both office work and gaming. Its universal size and neutral design fit any desk setup, while the precision surface supports smooth cursor control for everyday tasks and fast-paced gameplay alike.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Non-slip rubber base:</strong> The natural rubber underside grips the desk firmly, preventing unwanted movement during intense gaming sessions or busy workdays.</p></li><li><p><strong>Wear-resistant surface:</strong> The textured cloth top is built to withstand heavy daily use, resisting fraying and maintaining a consistent glide over time.</p></li><li><p><strong>Precision tracking:</strong> The optimized surface works with optical and laser mice, delivering accurate cursor movement for detailed design work or competitive play.</p></li><li><p></p></li></ul><div class=\"section-img\"><img src=\"https://test.ebuyl.com/api/v1/files/products/2026/08/28/e138eb942c43767ab27c07c0b08a216b.jpg\" alt=\"Mouse pad with mouse on top showing surface texture\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"></div><h2>Product Specifications</h2><table style=\"min-width: 50px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Attribute</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Brand</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>TIGERWINGS</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Mouse Mat</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Material</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Rubber (base)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Surface</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Wear-resistant cloth</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Compatibility</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Optical and laser mice</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Intended Use</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Office, gaming, home</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Use Scenarios</h2><p>This mouse pad is versatile enough for a variety of environments. In the office, it provides a steady surface for precise spreadsheet work, graphic design, or long hours of browsing. For gamers, the non-slip base and smooth tracking support quick flicks and consistent aim in fast-paced titles.</p><h2>Installation Instructions</h2><p>No tools or assembly are required. Simply follow these steps:</p><ol><li><p>Clear your desk surface of dust and debris.</p></li><li><p>Place the mouse pad rubber-side down on the desk.</p></li><li><p>Press down gently across the entire pad to ensure full contact with the surface.</p></li><li><p>Position your mouse on the pad and begin use.</p></li></ol><div class=\"section-img\"><img src=\"https://test.ebuyl.com/api/v1/files/products/2026/08/28/ff1227b1acf83a7b33908eb679210327.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of mouse pad edge and rubber base\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"></div><h2></h2><h2></h2><p></p>",
